  "notes": "Prevent held IR fixation from bypassing display-idle wake admission; retain recent idle wake causes in SLEEP STATUS. Fix first-use power-test storage, preserve existing records on NVS errors, and expose storage error reasons. Allow cooler spin-up before sampling and require two heater measurements within the existing safety deadline. Correct Ukrainian and English power-test text and improve result readability. Physical idle/wake and load-measurement acceptance remains pending.",
